case "E-excuse me, did you leave a message to the receptionist for me?": return "打、打扰一下，是你在前台给我留了话吗？";
case "Mmmm... Hehe ok big Sis I will do my best <3": return "嗯……嘿嘿，好呀，大姐姐，我会努力的<3";
case "I already know that story.": return "那个故事我已经听过了。";
case "Oops, you look great but I'll need them back.": return "哎呀，穿着真好看，不过这些衣服得还给我。";
case "Wow Line those Smoosher outfits?": return "哇，莱茵，那是斯慕舍餐厅的制服？";
case "All right, come behind the counter.": return "行，来柜台后面。";
case "I do the basics, cut damage and every so often I upgrade a cut cube.": return "我会些基础招数，造成斩击伤害，偶尔还能升级一个斩击方块。";
case "I recommend you to improve your life so you don't die with one of my attacks.": return "建议你先提升生命值，免得挨我一下就死。";
case "Thanks for the help, you need something?": return "谢谢帮忙，有什么需要的吗？";
case ".... Mhmm Sir? please don't kill anyone.": return "……嗯，先生？请别杀人。";
case "Mr. Vasera, what are you doing here?": return "瓦瑟拉先生，你怎么在这里？";
case "Que considerado <3": return "真体贴<3";
case "Please... Help me, I need those crystals to go back home.": return "求求你……帮帮我，我需要那些水晶才能回家。";
case "Yes please, I have other things to do.": return "好的，拜托了，我还有别的事。";
case "Sorry, I have other things to do.": return "抱歉，我还有别的事。";
case "Here, it's 100 Arcs just... dont blow it.": return "给，100阿克……别搞砸了就行。";
case "What do you care.": return "关你什么事。";
case "To the ground now!": return "立刻趴下！";
case "Oh, haha I like the idea but I don't have much time left I have to leave now.": return "哦，哈哈，这主意不错，不过我没时间了，必须走了。";
case "Please don't bring me bad news.": return "拜托，别给我带来坏消息。";
case "What are you looking at!?": return "看什么看！？";
case "*Kamiko grabs Line tightly and kisses her for a long minute*": return "*神子紧紧抱住莱茵，足足吻了她一分钟*";
case "Hmmm, Aren't you the cutest thing?, just a kiss from you would be enough.": return "嗯，你怎么这么可爱？给我一个吻就够了。";
case "Excellent lady, have a nice day <3.": return "太好了，女士，祝你今天愉快<3。";
case "I told you Line, let's capture her maybe the guards give us money.": return "莱茵，我就说吧，把她抓起来，说不定守卫会给我们赏钱。";
case "Sorry, I cant right now.": return "对不起，现在不行。";
case "Come back when you have Arcs.": return "有阿克了再来。";
case "Hey Line you figured out where I keep all my Arcs.": return "嘿，莱茵，你猜到我把阿克全藏在哪儿了吗？";
case "Please let me explain.": return "请听我解释。";
case "Yes, yes I understand you, sorry for wasting your time :c.": return "嗯嗯，我明白。对不起，耽误你时间了:c。";
case "Well you know... fire ehh sacred ... of elf (Iam a terrible liar :C).": return "那个，你懂的……火，呃，神圣的……精灵的火。（我可真不会撒谎:C。）";
case "OHh hu-hu-hu wha-what kind of experiences do you need.": return "哦，呵、呵呵，你、你需要什么样的经历？";
case "The world is a better place with you in it, whether you like it or not.": return "不管你愿不愿意承认，有你在，这个世界就更美好了。";
case "Ya great but I didn't ask you about your life": return "行，真棒，可我没问你的人生故事。";
case "As I pray I can hear the prayers of women in trouble and bring justice.": return "祈祷时，我能听见遇难女子的祈求，然后前去伸张正义。";
case "What a brave boy ;c": return "真勇敢的孩子;c";
case "I was told that I can earn some money by selling my own 'milk'.": return "听说卖自己的“奶”，就能赚点钱。";
case "What happened to you?": return "你怎么了？";
case "Oh he doesn't have a cow outfit.": return "哦，他没有奶牛装。";
case "Line! focus on your objective, we are looking for your friend.": return "莱茵！专心点，我们是来找你朋友的。";
case "Hi, sweetie, would you like to join me for a drink?": return "嗨，宝贝，要陪我喝一杯吗？";
case "I wouldn't miss it for anything in the world.": return "说什么我都不会错过。";
case "*blushed* th-thank you it is a relief that you liked it.": return "*脸红*谢、谢谢，你能喜欢，我就放心了。";
case "Oh, well if you wan..": return "哦，要是你想……";
case "Excuse me? that no way of speaking if I were your mother I would punish you.": return "什么？怎么能这样说话！我要是你妈妈，非罚你不可。";
case "I will do my best I will be worthy of the sword *reverence*.": return "我会尽力，不辜负这把剑。*行礼*";
case "Thank you very much I will not let you down and I will bring the sword.": return "太感谢了！我不会让你失望，一定会把剑带来。";
case "Hello sir, are you by any chance the author of The Pelletclad Blade?": return "你好，先生，请问你是《弹丸之刃》的作者吗？";
case "Looks like a writer?": return "他看着像作家吗？";
case "Well, it all depends on whether you admire atropomorphic animals like wolves.": return "嗯，得看你喜不喜欢狼这一类拟人动物。";
case "Mmm I do not know what's in it for me?": return "嗯，不知道，我有什么好处？";
case "I don't know Line looks like a weirdo.": return "不知道，莱茵，他看着像个怪人。";
case "OH how cute I love your fluffy little ears <3.": return "哦，好可爱！你毛茸茸的小耳朵，我太喜欢了<3。";
case "... H-hi e- that's a costume?": return "……你、你好，呃，那是套扮装服？";
case "No I am still short of money :c.": return "没有，我的钱还不够:c。";
case "Ohhhh I love it I love it I love it I love it that's all I wanted <3!": return "哦——好喜欢，好喜欢，好喜欢，好喜欢！就是我想要的<3！";
case "Thank you very much but I am no longer Line now call me Bluebell.": return "非常感谢，不过我已经不叫莱茵了，现在请叫我蓝铃。";
case "Only the family may enter this sanctuary.": return "只有家族成员能进入这座圣所。";
case "Come on Run! I bet 1000 Arcs on you Hu HU HU HU HUghg!.": return "快跑啊！我可在你身上押了1000阿克，呼哈哈哈哈！";
case "Ho hello are you a gorilla?": return "你、你好，你是大猩猩吗？";
case "Oh I *hip* see, you are allies of the empire trying to erase part of history.": return "哦，我*嗝*懂了，你们是帝国的同伙，想抹掉那段历史。";
case "Mmm ... n-no, i didn't know i'm half elf half succubus actually.": return "嗯……不、不是，其实我是半精灵、半魅魔。";
case "Hey, yo skinny girl do something good and bring me some beer *hip*.": return "喂，那个瘦姑娘，做点好事，给我拿杯啤酒来。*嗝*";
case "Line ... let's get out of here.": return "莱茵……我们走吧。";
case "I will repair it after a few drinks haha.": return "喝上几杯，我就去修，哈哈。";
case "So you are the prankster!": return "原来你就是那个捣蛋鬼！";
case "I guess when he fled he found this cave.": return "我猜，他逃跑的时候发现了这个洞窟。";
case "Why is it here anyway?": return "话说，它为什么会在这里？";
case "Oh... could happen to anyone.": return "哦……谁都有可能遇上。";
case "I hope Whipsie is doing well on Tricotex.": return "希望薇普茜在特里科特克斯过得好。";
case "This farm reminds me of home.": return "这个农场，让我想起了家。";
case "Take it for granted me and Line can against everything!": return "放心吧，我和莱茵联手，什么都能摆平！";
case "Wow really can we help to capture it ?!": return "哇，真的？我们能帮忙抓它吗？！";
case "H-hi you are Sa-Sam the hero o-of the Tricotex right :O?": return "你、你好，你是萨、萨姆，特、特里科特克斯的英雄，对吧:O？";
case "sorry same I have other things to do.": return "对不起，萨姆，我还有别的事。";
case "Sorry same I have other things to do.": return "对不起，萨姆，我还有别的事。";
case "Let's catch that criminal <3.": return "去抓那个罪犯吧<3。";
case "I do a lot of magic damage that's all you need to know.": return "我会造成大量魔法伤害，你知道这些就够了。";
case "I really want to help you Faye.": return "我真的想帮你，菲伊。";
case "If you want to help me just don't waste my time.": return "想帮忙，就别浪费我的时间。";
case "I think it's southeast from here.": return "我想，应该在这儿的东南方。";
case "I know you will, with enough practice you will beat him like I did <3.": return "你会做到的。只要勤加练习，你也能像我一样打败他<3。";
case "Thanks for the help, traveler.": return "谢谢帮忙，旅行者。";
case "Besides, I don't think your way of fighting will work for me anyway hahaha.": return "再说，我觉得你的战斗方式，反正也不适合我，哈哈哈。";
case "Isn't it precious? This river is so peaceful, a perfect view for my retirement.": return "是不是很美？这条河这么宁静，正适合让我退休后天天欣赏。";
case "If you can get 1000 arcs I'll give you a girlfriend deal hehe.": return "攒到1000阿克，我就给你来个女友套餐，嘿嘿。";
case "Yes but that was a long time ago.": return "是啊，不过已经是很久以前的事了。";
case "Oh! I remembered she was in the XXX magazines that your mother had.": return "哦！想起来了，你妈妈那些色情杂志里有她。";
case "And you already know the prize <3.": return "奖品你也已经知道了<3。";
case "If you fail to undress I will take off one of your clothes.": return "要是没能脱掉衣服，我就脱掉你身上的一件。";
case "Oh ok i will waiting here.": return "哦，好，我在这儿等。";
case "So Line you want to buy ten minute in heaven <3?": return "所以，莱茵，想买十分钟的天堂之旅吗<3？";
case "haha it looks like you learned a lot <3.": return "哈哈，看来你学了不少嘛<3。";
case "This sucks, there is no alcohol and everyone thinks I'm a minor.": return "糟透了，没酒喝，所有人还都以为我没成年。";
case "Excuse me, What the fuck did you say?.": return "什么？你他妈刚才说什么？";
case "Looks Like you have nowhere to run.": return "看来你没地方逃了。";
case "I guess you're right thanks that calms me down a bit.": return "我想你说得对，谢谢，听了心里舒服多了。";
case "Yeah there's no need to fight.": return "对，没必要打架。";
case "Thank you you are nothing like your fairy friend.": return "谢谢，你跟你那个仙子朋友可一点也不像。";
case "It has been a tiring day I will go to look for her after a nap.": return "今天累坏了，我先睡一会儿，醒了再去找她。";
case "Blob blip blop D:!": return "咕噜咕叽咕噜D:！";
case "Oh Mmmm blup, blep blip?": return "哦，嗯，咕噜，咕叽咕叽？";
case "Bleb Bleb blub blub bleb.": return "咕叽咕叽咕噜咕噜咕叽。";
case "Bu-but I do not have much money ;c.": return "可、可我没多少钱;c。";
case "You are the traveler what are you doing here?!": return "你就是那个旅行者，怎么跑这里来了？！";
case "Dont worry I will take care of this demond": return "别担心，这个恶魔交给我。";
case "*Starts to sweat but maintains eye contact *... Crazy, right?": return "*开始冒汗，却仍强撑着直视对方*……挺离谱吧？";
case "Hmm, the witnesses said the thief went south of the church.": return "嗯，目击者说，窃贼往教堂南边去了。";
case "Wait, but how is that possible? Why would it be lying there?!": return "等等，怎么可能？为什么会丢在那里？！";
case "Yes, we will be exemplary citizens of society!": return "没错，我们会成为社会的模范公民！";
case "The barn will be up and running again once we have dealt with the problems.": return "等我们把这些问题解决，谷仓就会恢复营业。";
case "But you can ask local owners or even artists on the streets.": return "不过，你可以问问本地店主，或者街头艺人。";
case "Welcome to the cariel town.": return "欢迎来到卡里尔镇。";
case "I'm sorry miss but it's closed for now.": return "抱歉，小姐，暂时不开放。";
case "Then what do we do?": return "那我们怎么办？";
case "Is the cause of alcohol not reaching the town?": return "这就是酒运不到镇上的原因？";
case "A demon? I heard a traveler beat her.": return "恶魔？听说有个旅行者打败她了。";
case "I think this is the last beer in the bar.": return "这大概是酒吧最后一杯啤酒了。";
case "I should patrol while I wait for the next shipment.": return "等下一批货到的时候，我应该去巡逻一下。";
case "these guards are idiots they didn't even see the trail.": return "这帮守卫真蠢，连痕迹都没看见。";
case "Ok calm down I will help you get this thing off.": return "好，冷静点，我帮你把这东西弄下来。";
case "Seems to be waking up.": return "好像要醒了。";
case "Tell me something I do not know.": return "说点我不知道的。";
case "We are the best guards in town.": return "我们可是镇上最棒的守卫。";
case "Lili we must help them they do not seem to be lying.": return "莉莉，我们得帮他们，他们看起来不像在说谎。";
case "Due  she is a minor, you will have to pay the fine at the jail-farm.": return "由于她尚未成年，罚款需要你到监狱农场缴纳。";
case "I'm not going to that place with that sucking milk machine 2000.": return "有那台吸奶机2000在，我才不去那个地方。";
case "I will take you to the jail-farm for assault on social security entities.": return "袭击维护社会治安的执法人员，我得把你带去监狱农场。";
case "Line look a store maybe you can buy new equipment.": return "莱茵，看，有家店，说不定能买点新装备。";
case "Then you go to equipment and in the section where you have the boots on.": return "接着打开装备栏，找到装备靴子的那一格。";
case "No! You're wrong, I just want to be a little stronger, nothing more.": return "不是！你想错了，我只是想稍微变强一点，没别的。";
case "People have to know that the red tent will open soon so im kinda busy.": return "得让大家知道红色帐篷快开张了，所以我现在有点忙。";
case "Give those pamphlets to people while I get ready.": return "我准备的时候，你去把这些传单发给大家。";
case "*whisper* oh god the jokes of this bitch.": return "*低声*天哪，这贱人的笑话真是够了。";
case "Hi Line, how have you bee-n.": return "嗨，莱茵，最近过得怎——么样。";
case "Welcome to the green hills hotel at the moment we do not have rooms available.": return "欢迎来到绿丘旅馆，目前客房已满。";
case "Oh-sorry i havent sleep lately.": return "哦，对不起，最近一直没睡好。";
case "Mshonney have new workers.": return "蜜糖女士招了新员工。";
case "ok ok just give me a sec": return "好，好，等我一下。";
case "I-I can't here callie, you know I'm shy, there are a lot of people here": return "我、我不能在这里，卡莉，你知道我害羞，这里人太多了。";
case "Oh ok, your kids send you good vibes since they can't come.": return "哦，好吧，你的孩子们虽然来不了，也托我祝你一切顺利。";
case "Hey Line come here.": return "嘿，莱茵，过来。";
case "Wait are you the saleswoman's son?": return "等等，你是那个售货员的儿子？";
case "No, but I know that north from here they did the same to a fox girl.": return "没有，不过听说北边有个狐女，也被这样整了。";
case "Oh do not worry I will take that thing from you.": return "哦，别担心，我帮你把那东西拿掉。";
case "Mmm no, and have you seen a blue cat by chance?": return "嗯，没有。话说，你见过一只蓝猫吗？";
case "Hello by chance have you seen someone with wings on their head?": return "你好，有没有见过一个头上长着翅膀的人？";
case "It's easy, I'll lend you money and you return it to me later with an extra 10%": return "很简单，我借你钱，你之后还我，再多付10%。";
case "Me mmm .. not really": return "我？嗯……还真没有。";
case "Amazing, it's great to do deals with you.": return "太棒了，跟你做生意真愉快。";
case "Yes, here is your money.": return "有，钱在这里。";
case "Sure just sign here": return "当然，在这里签字就行。";
case "You need money again?": return "又缺钱了？";
case "...sorry for getting you into this moo..": return "……对不起，把你卷进这件事，哞……";
case "My mom told me not to talk to strangers.": return "妈妈说，不能跟陌生人说话。";
case "Thanks for helping my family.": return "谢谢你帮助我的家人。";
case "Those are weird clothes for an elf, come on in": return "对精灵来说，这身衣服倒挺奇怪，进来吧。";
case "Not now, I'm watching that none of these cows attempt a breakout.": return "现在不行，我得看着这些牛，免得有哪个又想越狱。";
case "*whispering* What a stupid thing to do.": return "*小声*真是蠢透了。";
case "She will be there don't worry Callie.": return "她会在那里的，卡莉，别担心。";
case "Well, hehe that was  awesome.": return "好吧，嘿嘿，刚才真棒。";
case "Come, join us for lunch.": return "来，陪我们一起吃午饭。";
case "Line! You arrived, did you see the feast I have prepared?": return "莱茵！你来了！看到我准备的这桌大餐了吗？";
case "Mmmmm, oHhh, Ah ha wooooow.\nI forgot I can't read.": return "嗯，哦，啊哈，哇——。\n忘了，我不识字。";
case "I'm really sorry ava, I believe lili": return "真的对不起，艾娃，我相信莉莉。";
case "but why ava, what have i done to you i thought we were best friends": return "可是为什么啊，艾娃，我做错了什么？我以为我们是最好的朋友。";
case "don't believe this crazy bitch she she tries to murder you and your mother": return "别信这个疯婊子，她、她想杀了你和你妈妈！";
case "don't worry Line everything will be fine you don't need to do anything": return "放心，莱茵，一切都会好的，你什么都不用做。";
case "Thanks but i beat the Demond for reasons of my own.": return "谢谢，不过我是为了自己的事，才去打败那个恶魔的。";
case "Go to the door on your left Sieki is waiting for you.": return "去左边那扇门，茜姬在等你。";
case "Nothing to do let's give her money back if you have an idea you can tell her.": return "没办法，把钱还给她吧。想到什么主意，也可以告诉她。";
case "Ohh eh mmm yeah sure eh he-he.": return "哦，呃，嗯，对，当然，嘿、嘿嘿。";
case "Forgive her please, she has no filters when she speaks :c.": return "求你原谅她，她说话没个把门的:c。";
case "Yeah, she is crazy.": return "是啊，她脑子不正常。";
case "The competition to find out who is the best onahole is for VIP customers only.": return "谁是最佳肉便器的比赛，只限贵宾客户参加。";
case "Most likely she is in the town, you just have to go through the tunnel.": return "她多半在镇上，穿过隧道就能到。";
case "I'm looking for someone, a woman in a black dress.": return "我在找人，一个穿黑裙子的女人。";
case "Okay couple of weirdos, Line we have to go.": return "行了，两个怪人。莱茵，我们得走了。";
case "Oh bu-but not here! someone could see us an-and stuff.": return "哦，可、可是不能在这儿！会、会被人看见的。";
case "Hi Line you already found the person you were looking for.": return "嗨，莱茵，找到你要找的人了吗？";
case "Yeah listen we want to change we will give you a footjob for your fish.": return "对，听着，我们想换个交易：给你足交，换你的鱼。";
case "Yeah, and we sense you get excited when she talk about her feets.": return "是啊，而且感觉她一提到脚，你就兴奋起来了。";
case "I'm not sorry just let me take off my boots.": return "没事，先让我把靴子脱了。";
case "No, don't you dare leave them on.": return "不，敢穿着试试，脱掉。";
case "You can have the whole bucket of fish.": return "整桶鱼都给你。";
case "Do your best work girl do me proud.": return "姑娘，拿出你的真本事，让我长长脸。";
case "Great! Line will give you the sloppy Blowjob you're looking for!": return "太好了！莱茵会给你来一场口水淋漓的口交，保你满意！";
case "The girl didn't have much saliva left when it was your turn let me try.": return "轮到你的时候，这姑娘口水已经不多了，让我试试。";
case "This was a complete scam.": return "这完全就是个骗局。";
case "Hey, I found this crystal first!.": return "喂，这块水晶是我先找到的！";
