case "Oh Vasuki, I really would like to kiss that angelic face of yours.": return "哦，瓦苏基，真想亲亲你那张天使般的脸。";
case "Vasuki and Line eat the exotic fruits.": return "瓦苏基和莱茵吃下了异界水果。";
case "You know what, I could stay here a while longer and be with you.": return "这样吧，我可以多留一会儿，陪着你。";
case "A well-deserved rest after helping every DAM islander you bump into!": return "逮着岛民就帮，帮了他妈的每一个人，终于该歇歇了！";
case "Help me please! I feel like I'm going to explode, I really need it!": return "求你帮我！感觉要炸了，真的好想要！";
case "I don't recognize you...": return "我不认识你……";
case "Line, are you okay, did you relax? It's the first time I've seen you like this.": return "莱茵，你还好吗？放松下来了？第一次看见你这样。";
case "Shit that woman hit me in the balls in the Sabbath.": return "妈的，那女人在女巫集会里踢了我的蛋。";
case "I'm half elf so I think it comes from that ahah.": return "我有一半精灵血统，应该就是因为这个，哈哈。";
case "I am waiting, that they attend one of the miners.": return "我在等他们给一个矿工治疗。";
case "Mmmm well, if it is something small": return "嗯，只要是件小事。";
case "If you don't need anything, could you do me a little favor?": return "没什么需要的话，能帮我个小忙吗？";
case "Oh ,well the truth no, but thanks.": return "哦，其实没什么，不过谢谢。";
case "It can be done without it but it is not recommended.": return "不做也可以，不过不推荐。";
case "Mmmm so if someone does it for that place is it necessary what you offer me?": return "嗯，所以要从那里做，就必须用你这项服务？";
case "You still don't have the money? don't worry, I can wait until you get it.": return "钱还不够？没关系，我可以等你凑齐。";
case "All right, I'll be waiting here if you change your mind.": return "好吧，改主意的话，我就在这里等。";
case "Yes please (pay for the service).": return "好的，麻烦了。（支付服务费。）";
case "Do you want to pay for anal cleaning services?": return "是否支付肛门清洁服务费？";
case "Eh.. a-are you ok?(Wow is very pretty)": return "呃……你、你没事吧？（哇，真漂亮。）";
case "Let's get on with it already then!": return "那就赶紧开始！";
case "Hey line, are you really gonna help this brat?": return "喂，莱茵，你真要帮这个臭丫头？";
case "Alright, get to it then already!": return "行了，赶快动手！";
case "Are you really going to help a stranger who kicked your ass?": return "连揍过你的陌生人，也真要帮？";
case "* Faye begins to sob *": return "*菲开始抽泣*";
case "Are you SURE this isn't the year 3000 AD?": return "确定这里不是公元3000年？";
case "No, sorry actually it's 201 AO.": return "不是，抱歉，其实是AO201年。";
case "Dumbass, we've been telling you that from the beginning!": return "笨蛋，从一开始就在告诉你！";
case "Is she alright? No magicians I've ever known had to chant stuff to cast magic.": return "她没事吧？我认识的魔法师，没一个需要念叨着施法。";
case "Alright, so let's see some magic!": return "好，来看看魔法吧！";
case "Faye We have to let ourselves lose!": return "菲，我们得故意输掉！";
case "It would be a good idea, if we had done some damage!": return "前提是咱们打得出伤害，那主意才算好！";
case "Very proud of you Line.": return "很为你骄傲，莱茵。";
case "It sounds like you're leaving.": return "听起来，你要走了。";
case "We finally had a stroke of luck now it's all over.": return "终于走运了，这下总算结束。";
case "I was able to create the first primitive, circular body by surface tension.": return "借助表面张力，我造出了最初的原始圆形身体。";
case "Can I take this criminal with me? It would be a great help.": return "能把这个罪犯交给我带走吗？能帮上大忙。";
case "Hey here you don't talk you damn cow!": return "喂，这儿没你说话的份，臭奶牛！";
case "Hey! What the fuck are you doing?!": return "喂！你他妈在干什么？！";
case "Go turn on the machine.": return "去把机器打开。";
case "(Big thing i just won't say anything)": return "（有什么大不了的，不说话就是。）";
case "Line, I understand that cows can only say moo.": return "莱茵，我记得奶牛只能说“哞”。";
case "Uyy look Line is not a cute cow <3?": return "哎呀，莱茵，这奶牛不可爱吗<3？";
case "Sure just give me a second.": return "好，等我一下。";
case "*whispering * Line turn on the machine and let's get the hell out of here.": return "*小声说*莱茵，打开机器，我们赶紧离开这鬼地方。";
case "Now you can turn on that machine I have a lot of milk in these udders.": return "可以打开机器了，我这乳房里全是奶。";
case "I like the place, maybe I killed and drank so much because I was frustrated.": return "我喜欢这里，也许以前杀那么多人、喝那么多酒，都是因为太压抑。";
case "It seems that we meet again.": return "看来，又见面了。";
case "Tristan is not a puppet!.": return "特里斯坦才不是傀儡！";
case "And that fairy i guess.": return "还有那只妖精吧。";
case "Oh it's you, you really think i'll stay here forever.": return "哦，是你，真以为我会永远留在这里？";
case "Mm-m moo (what's planned?)": return "哞、哞哞。（什么计划？）";
case "hey cows just say moo!": return "喂，奶牛只能说“哞”！";
case "Lili .. n-do-do not do anything weird please.": return "莉莉……别、别乱来，求你了。";
case "Did you put on your cow clothes?": return "奶牛装穿好了吗？";
case "(Wow, just say you want to get milked to the brain)": return "（哇，想被挤奶挤到脑子都空掉就直说。）";
case "Hey come on, give us a warning, we have done more than any citizen of Elira.": return "喂，拜托，警告一次就好了吧。我们做的事，比艾莉拉任何市民都多。";
case "Wait and how do you know that they made a loan to Line.": return "等等，你怎么知道她们借钱给莱茵了？";
case "You see that woman with purple hair.": return "看见那个紫头发女人了吗？";
case "Oh, I didn't know :c.": return "哦，我不知道:c。";
case "Great let's go right away someone could be in danger.": return "太好了，马上去，也许有人正遇到危险。";
case "Oh by the way I think something happened to your friend.": return "哦，对了，你朋友好像出了点事。";
case "Hey leave her alone!": return "喂，放开她！";
case "Help the dragon maybe she gives us a reward.": return "帮帮那个龙女，说不定会给谢礼。";
case "And why don't you help her?!": return "那你为什么不去帮？！";
case "Hey! what's happening here?": return "喂！这里怎么回事？";
case "Vasuki The Silver Dragon of Luminous": return "瓦苏基，卢米纳斯的银龙";
case "We know where it is, we will help you to return home.": return "我们知道在哪儿，会帮你回家的。";
case "Lili! Excuse her, she was born without touch.": return "莉莉！抱歉，她天生不懂分寸。";
case "That crystal, why is it so important to you?": return "那块水晶，为什么对你这么重要？";
case "Relax, it was nothing.": return "没事，小意思。";
case "Wait you forgot to take the crystal.": return "等等，你忘拿水晶了。";
case "Hey Line I think I have an idea.": return "喂，莱茵，我有个主意。";
case "get naked, if that doesn't get you noticed, nothing will.": return "脱光。这样还引不起注意，就没别的办法了。";
case "Why did you untie me?!": return "为什么给我松绑？！";
case "Oh it's out of order, I really want to go to the bathroom :c.": return "哦，坏了，我真的好想上厕所:c。";
case "No, over my dead body you ruin my whole plan!": return "不行，想毁掉我的整个计划，除非从我尸体上踩过去！";
case "WHAT? But I'm the one who has to do it.": return "什么？可这事明明该我做。";
case "Don't worry SieKi I will run the place even better than you.": return "别担心，茜姬，我会把这里管得比你还好。";
case "Then she will take your place for a while, Sieki?": return "茜姬，那就暂时由她代替你？";
case "Oh I am sorry I am sorry I am running right now.": return "哦，对不起，对不起，马上就跑。";
case "Of course, there is no problem <3.": return "当然，没问题<3。";
case "Line, calm down. Ahh, my head, what's happening?": return "莱茵，冷静。啊，头好痛，怎么回事？";
case "B-ut I am succubus, they should be the ones desiring me more!": return "可、可我是魅魔，他们不该更想要我吗！";
case "Maybe I better leave.": return "我还是走吧。";
case "Ugh, what a horrible nightmare has happened?": return "呃，好可怕的噩梦，发生什么了？";
case "Hey! What do you think you're doing?": return "喂！你想干什么？";
case "Hehe I know a way that you can save your little friend.": return "嘿嘿，我知道一个办法，能救你的小朋友。";
case "I told you that your attempt to catch me was useless.": return "早告诉你了，想抓我，白费力气。";
case "Lili! do not be rude.": return "莉莉！别没礼貌。";
case "Ple-please let me go I can not continue like this.": return "求、求你放我走，不能再这样了。";
case "Wait please let me talk.": return "等等，求你，让我说话。";
case "Yes! I mean no, I dont know D:.": return "对！我是说，不，不知道D:。";
case "What that hell are you doing?!": return "你到底在干什么？！";
case "Oh di-did you call me?": return "哦，你、你叫我？";
case "Hey you, come here!": return "喂，你，过来！";
case "Lili, you are a genius. Are you sure you haven't done this before?": return "莉莉，你真是天才，确定以前没做过？";
case "Ehem, I am going to change my clothes, you-you bring someone.": return "咳，我去换衣服，你、你把人带来。";
case "Don't worry, I just said it to make her go away.": return "别担心，只是想让她走才那么说。";
case "AHh Lili help me!": return "啊，莉莉，救我！";
case "Shouldn't we take it to the guards?": return "不该把它交给卫兵吗？";
case "Look Lili what I found.": return "看，莉莉，我发现了什么。";
case "Should not we take it to the guards?": return "不该把它交给卫兵吗？";
case "Hey! that ball is not the one I handed it to him, it looks like glass.": return "喂！这球不是我之前交给他的那个，看起来像玻璃。";
case "I'm sorry Line I really have to go.": return "抱歉，莱茵，我真的得走了。";
case "It seems that I must teach these bad girls how to behave.": return "看来，得教教这些坏女孩，怎样才叫乖。";
case "Line these two will not leave the crystal we will have to take it by force.": return "莱茵，她们两个不肯交水晶，只能硬抢了。";
case "Why are your so mean?": return "为什么这么坏？";
case "I have not rested since I came to this dimension.": return "来到这个次元以后，我一直没休息。";
case "Now, I just have to ...": return "现在，只要……";
case "Thank you very much Line, I can finally return home.": return "莱茵，太谢谢你了，终于能回家了。";
case "That so terrible she looked such a good woman.": return "太可怕了，她看着明明是个好女人。";
case "What! we must tell the great captain.": return "什么！得告诉大队长。";
case "Hi Vasuki, what are you doing here?": return "嗨，瓦苏基，在这里做什么？";
case "Bell that is beautiful.": return "贝尔，真美。";
case "Yes, there are a many.": return "对，有很多。";
case "Lili don't be mean you can fly, besides I have my tights wet :c": return "莉莉，别坏心眼，你能飞，可我的连裤袜都湿了:c";
case "Hey want to play danglinging-ass-rope? You can play for 50 Arcs.": return "喂，想玩悬绳荡屁股吗？50阿克币一次。";
case "Hey to use the onaholes you need a ticket!": return "喂，使用人形飞机杯需要票！";
case "Hi I'm SailorCum just turn around to give you a rimjob.": return "嗨，我是水手射精娘，转过去，让我给你舔肛。";
case "Do not bother them Lili let's keep going.": return "别打扰她们，莉莉，继续走吧。";
case "... Wow, what a dumm ass I will tell her the truth.": return "……哇，真是个傻子，我去告诉她真相。";
case "... You are lucky to be cute Line.": return "……莱茵，幸亏你长得可爱。";
case "Hey wait give me a brake that woman left me a little tired.": return "喂，等等，让我喘口气，那女人把我弄得有点累。";
case "So you have fun Line? <3": return "莱茵，玩得开心吗？<3";
case "Attention everyone, the 24 hour marathon begins!": return "各位注意，24小时马拉松现在开始！";
case "All right girls get into your poses.": return "好，姑娘们，摆好姿势。";
case "Ah yes and that to...": return "啊，对，还有那个……";
case "UHHH~ I ca not feel my legs.": return "呜——~腿都没知觉了。";
case "I am glad that with this I will not disappear from the island he.. hehe.": return "真高兴，这样就不会从岛上消失了，嘿……嘿嘿。";
case "Yes, so what? What will you do?": return "对，所以呢？你要怎么做？";
case "This will be the deal eat the fura fura fruit and get an assjob from me.": return "交易是这样：吃下芙拉芙拉果，让我用屁股帮你夹射。";
case "But don't you see that most of the women here are anchored to the walls!": return "没看见这里大部分女人，都被固定在墙上吗！";
case "Lucy, what are you doing here?": return "露西，你怎么在这儿？";
case "Excellent! Line eats this Fura Fura fruit and Lili let's do our best.": return "太好了！莱茵，吃下这颗芙拉芙拉果。莉莉，我们全力以赴。";
case "Don't worry, as long as the line is excited, I can get bigger.": return "别担心，只要莱茵兴奋，我就能变大。";
case "We will help you with whatever you need.": return "有什么需要，我们都帮。";
case "Thank you very much <3.": return "太谢谢了<3。";
case "I gave him the VIP for God's sake! Pietra stop being so annoying!": return "我都给他VIP了，天哪！皮埃特拉，别这么烦人！";
case "Hey, what's all the fuss!": return "喂，吵什么呢！";
case "Ohh I am sorry but I do not think I will be able to hold on!": return "哦，抱歉，我好像坚持不住了！";
case "I will eat them now since we ran all the way here and I need to regain energy.": return "一路跑来，得补充精力，我现在就吃。";
case "Ah! ahh, yes, thanks, thank you very much.": return "啊！啊，对，谢谢，太感谢了。";
case "I hope this sticks in your mind the next time you judge someone.": return "下次评判别人时，希望你还能记得这一刻。";
case "You ask me what I will do, WHAT I WILL DO?!": return "问我要做什么，我要做什么？！";
case "We'd better leave her alone": return "还是别打扰她了。";
case "Wow so she lost everything?": return "哇，所以她失去了一切？";
case "Yes, but there seems to be something else going on.": return "对，不过似乎还有别的事。";
case "MMmm she kind of scares me, let's wait for someone else to be brought in.": return "嗯，她有点吓人，还是等别人被带过来吧。";
case "So who goes first?": return "谁先来？";
case "UY I am sorry I am sorry I did not mean it in a bad way. ;c": return "哎呀，对不起，对不起，我没有恶意。;c";
case "The VIP ninety-seven, applause for our beautiful Judge!": return "VIP九十七号，请为我们美丽的裁判鼓掌！";
case "Now it's the fairy Liliana's turn, go to the indicated position.": return "接下来轮到妖精莉莉安娜，请前往指定位置。";
case "Line come on, it's not really that big a deal.": return "莱茵，别这样，其实真没什么大不了。";
case "The winner of the Competition is Li...Liana!": return "本场比赛的赢家是，莉……莉安娜！";
case "Until he finally made his decision.": return "直到他终于下定决心。";
case "... Thank you very much, both of you, for participating.": return "……非常感谢你们两位参加。";
case "This will be the best, a fairy affected by the energy of a succubus Guau!": return "这一定最棒，受魅魔精力影响的妖精，哇！";
case "Why are they looking at an empty jar, are they stupid?": return "她们干吗盯着空罐子看，傻了吗？";
case "Uff very viscous it looks like someone has been to smooshers many times <3.": return "呼，好黏稠，看来有人没少去揉揉店<3。";
case "Ohhh yes! It was better than running with a branch in my mouth Ruuff!": return "哦，太棒了！比嘴里叼树枝跑来跑去还爽，汪！";
case "Of course if line <3 and I see that you have improved in combat.": return "当然，莱茵<3，而且看得出，你战斗也进步了。";
case "Line! come here is show time.": return "莱茵！过来，好戏开始。";
case "Shit that's great, how much does it cost?": return "妈的，太棒了，多少钱？";
case "Ahhh! I'm not very good at this but I must keep trying.": return "啊！我不擅长这个，不过得继续努力。";
case "So please do me a favor and don't tell anyone.": return "所以拜托，别告诉任何人。";
case "Don't tell Red how I got it I think she would be sad if she knew.": return "别告诉蕾德我是怎么弄到的，她知道了一定会难过。";
case "Hmm ... okay but don't be as loud as usual, okay Solstice?": return "嗯……好，不过别像平时那么吵，好吗，索尔斯蒂斯？";
case "What you don't like being with your awesome sister?": return "怎么，不喜欢和你超棒的姐姐待在一起？";
case "What-what kind of pri-prize.": return "什、什么样的奖、奖励？";
case "Hey, you the one with blue hair!": return "喂，蓝头发的那个！";
case "What am I doing, hehe, the club is closed during the day.": return "我在干什么，嘿嘿？夜店白天不开门。";
case "What? but I just wanted to help. :c": return "什么？可我只是想帮忙。:c";
case "Sure, all at once, maybe you are an idiot.": return "对，一股脑全说出来，也许你就是个笨蛋。";
case "I trust that they leave their position again because the house has no value.": return "那房子没什么价值，我相信他们还会再次擅离职守。";
case "At least it's something.": return "至少有点收获。";
case "I Hire Alura to help me solve this problem.": return "我雇了阿露拉，帮我解决这个问题。";
case "Look if you want to help, it's okay, I recognize that you are strong.": return "想帮忙也行，我承认，你很强。";
case "Hey there is no need to fight now.": return "喂，没必要现在就打架。";
case "The two idiots that are guarding the abandoned house invite us.": return "是看守废弃房屋的那两个白痴叫我们来的。";
case "This Slime must be defeated now!": return "必须立刻打败这只史莱姆！";
case "Is very close to the hospital, where did it come from?": return "离医院这么近，从哪儿来的？";
case "We must help, hurry Line!": return "得帮忙，快点，莱茵！";
case "YES YES YES YES OK I WILL DO IT I NEED IT NOW Please let me TOUCH THAT PENIS!": return "好好好好，我做，我现在就要，求你，让我摸那根鸡巴！";
case "YES PLEASE TAKE MY MONEY!!!": return "好，求你，拿走我的钱！！！";
case "YES PLEASE TAKE MY MONEY": return "好，求你，拿走我的钱。";
case "Wha-what is so funny?": return "有、有这么好笑？";
case "Oh, n-no nothing, I-I have to go now bye.": return "哦，没、没什么，我、我该走了，再见。";
case "W-whhy? we could have had something beautiful.": return "为、为什么？明明可以拥有美好的关系。";
case "This smell, UFF, my head is spinning.": return "这味道，呼，头都晕了。";
case "This cock is so steamy.": return "这鸡巴好热腾腾。";
case "I am disgusting.": return "我真恶心。";
case "I could not tell her the truth.": return "没法告诉她真相。";
case "Oh baby you still can't control your impulses but that's okay don't worry.": return "哦，宝贝，你还是管不住冲动，不过没关系，别担心。";
case "What happened to you and why you smell like that?": return "出什么事了，身上怎么这味道？";
case "Line Finally I find you!": return "莱茵，终于找到你！";
case "This guy was a danger, a threat.": return "这家伙很危险，是个威胁。";
case "* sobbing * not until he treats me better and APOLOGIZE!": return "*抽泣*除非他对我好一点，而且道歉！";
