case "Are you talking to me,crossbreed?!": return "在跟我说话，杂种？！";
case "Mmm.. huh hi, yo ne-need help?": return "嗯，呃，你好，需、需要帮忙吗？";
case "What's going on, is this really the correct dimension ?!": return "怎么回事，这真是正确的次元？！";
case "The truth is that it was the slowest option.": return "其实，那是最慢的办法。";
case "I think ten souls will be enough to load the crystal.": return "十个灵魂，应该够给水晶充能了。";
