case "*I wish I have bigger tits ;C*": return "*真希望奶子能再大一点;C*";
case "Mmm.. I have never heard that thing on this island.": return "嗯……没听说岛上有那种东西。";
case "Uff tomorrow when they give us another place let's go back to the Sabbath.": return "呼，明天换个地方值守，再回女巫集会玩吧。";
