case "Hey isn't that the clothes stolen from smooshers?!": return "喂，那不是从揉揉店偷来的衣服？！";
case "You can go Line, it can be a lot for you.": return "莱茵，可以走，这对你来说可能太过了。";
case "I hope you enjoyed your time alive.": return "希望你享受过活着的日子。";
case "Your own minions defying your orders, pathetic.": return "连自己的手下都不听命令，可悲。";
case "Do you want me to go back to a pathetic being like you?": return "想让我变回你这种可悲的存在？";
