case "Yes, about that it did not work.": return "对，说到那个，没成功。";
case "I-I really don't know how to thank you for this.": return "我、我真的不知道怎么感谢。";
case "And who better for a family than Miss Marael! You are a genius!": return "能给她们一个家的人，谁比玛拉艾尔女士更合适！你是天才！";
case "What, but who Lili?!": return "什么，可是谁啊，莉莉？！";
case "You know what, I think I know who can help.": return "我想，知道谁能帮忙了。";
case "I will be the best clown on the island! <3.": return "一定要成为全岛最棒的小丑！<3。";
case "Oh you are the best of all heroes!": return "哦，你是所有英雄里最棒的！";
case "You are the best fri-sisters I could have ever had.": return "你们是我这辈子最好的朋、姐妹。";
case "Great go to the center of the circle of those people.": return "很好，到那群人围成的圈中央。";
case "They really mean. * whispers *": return "真正的意思是。*小声说*";
case "Do not worry, I am a great swimmer and I will win these watersports!": return "别担心，我游泳可厉害，水上运动一定会赢！";
case "Line, what are you doing here? Wait, how did you get in?": return "莱茵，怎么在这儿？等等，怎么进来的？";
case "Nonsense, I already feel UGH, fine.": return "胡说，已经感觉，呃，很好。";
case "Hey I fought for this place and no one will urgh, uagh take it away.": return "喂，这地方是我争来的，谁也别，呃，啊，想抢走。";
case "*Crowd* Can't you do something else? Yeah, like dancing or something?": return "*人群*不能干点别的？对，比如跳舞什么的？";
case "Wait, her future what?! ugh, URGH.": return "等等，她以后的什么？！呃，呜。";
case "I am-sorry I could not drink it.": return "对、不起，没喝下去。";
case "No one will take my sweet sunray-colored nectar from me!": return "谁也别想拿走我甜蜜、阳光色的甘露！";
case "If we put our feet together will you shut up?": return "我们把脚并在一起，你就闭嘴？";
