case "And then I gave her oral sex while she was working.": return "然后，她工作的时候，我给她口交了。";
case "OHhh I am very so-sorry but.": return "哦，我、我真的非常抱歉，可是……";
case "I-I am sorry b-buut I did it again.": return "对、对不起，可、可是我又做了。";
