case "( This is so wrong, I should never have masturbated here. )": return "（太不应该了，我就不该在这里自慰。）";
case "Now NOW LISTEN TO THIS! LISTEN TO IT!!!": return "现在，听着！听我说这件事！！！";
case "She secluded herself as a hermit to live in peace.": return "她隐居起来，只想平静地生活。";
case "I ended up fucking her and we had sex like crazy in the kitchen!": return "结果我上了她，我们在厨房里疯狂做爱！";
case "Si-sister listen to this listen!": return "修、修女，听我说，听我说！";
case "Re-remember the single mother I told you about?": return "还、还记得我跟你说的那个单亲妈妈吗？";
case "She asked me to be his girlfriend and I accepted!": return "她向我告白，要我当她女朋友，我答应了！";
case "Next we have sex like crazy, while his mother is cleaning the dishes!": return "接着，他妈妈在洗碗的时候，我们疯狂做爱！";
case "I start moaning louder while she thinks I am masturbating.": return "我故意叫得更大声，而她还以为，我在自慰。";
case "But she discovered us.": return "可她还是发现了我们。";
case "I WANTED HER TO CATCH ME DEVIRGINIZING HER SON!": return "我就是想让她撞见，我给她儿子破处！";
case "Mmm... miss you don't have enough Arcs.": return "嗯……小姐，你的阿克不够。";
case "Great! enter the mushroom field to start playing.": return "太好了！进蘑菇田，开始游戏吧。";
case "What are the rules?": return "规则是什么？";
case "No, not at this time.": return "不了，现在不玩。";
case "Hey want to play mushroom picking? You can play for 100 Arcs.": return "嘿，想玩采蘑菇吗？报名只需100阿克。";
case "Oh geez at least know how many arcs you have, come back when you have more.": return "哎呀，至少先弄清自己有多少阿克吧，钱多一点再来。";
case "Welcome to the lazy cat tent where we have the best products in this area.": return "欢迎来到懒猫帐篷，这一带最好的商品，都在这里。";
case "I still remember the feeling I felt when I first started talking to you.": return "还记得第一次跟你说话时，那种心动的感觉。";
case "I wish I was your mirror, so that I could look at you every morning.": return "真希望我是你的镜子，这样每天早上，都能看见你。";
case "Look like you will enjoy a good spanking.": return "看起来，你会喜欢好好挨一顿屁股。";
case "Looks nice on you.": return "你穿着很好看。";
case "Welcome to the evergreen shop the best shop in town.": return "欢迎来到常青商店，镇上最棒的店。";
case "A gift eh? well, bring some beers again so we can play for a bit.": return "礼物啊？那再带些啤酒来，我们就能一起玩会儿了。";
case "Thank you so much this will help me a lot!": return "太感谢了，这可帮了大忙！";
case "Haha cmon girl, I sold you that alredy.": return "哈哈，拜托，姑娘，那个已经卖给你了。";
case "What the matter, is not your style city girl?": return "怎么，城里姑娘，不合你口味？";
case "Ya are so kind, but my heart stays with my cows.": return "你真好，可我的心，已经留给奶牛们了。";
case "I've already sold you that Line.": return "莱茵，那个已经卖给你了。";
case "Oh Line you are short of Arcs to buy this.": return "哦，莱茵，买这个，你的阿克还不够。";
case "You'll look as beautiful as I do with it on.": return "穿上它，你也会跟我一样漂亮。";
case "Hello little Line.": return "你好，小莱茵。";
case "Hey, do you want a second round already?": return "嘿，这么快就想再来一轮了？";
case "Oh girl, you will look great i tell ya.": return "哦，姑娘，相信我，穿上肯定好看。";
case "Very well, shall we start with your divination?": return "好，我们开始占卜吗？";
case "What fate has in store for you..": return "命运为你准备了什么呢……";
case "In the dark west of the farm, a brown leather demon awaits you.": return "农场西边的黑暗中，棕色皮装的恶魔，正等着你。";
case "Ah! your-your destiny is blocked, it's hard for me to read it, but for ": return "啊！你、你的命运被阻挡了，很难看清，不过只要";
