case "Iughh is drenched in your squirt.": return "呃，都被你喷出的水浸透了。";
case "I am going to take it.": return "我要拿走。";
case "Oh and she left a letter by your side but your squirt left it on the floor": return "哦，她还在你旁边留了封信，可被你喷出的水，冲到地上去了。";
