case "I could not agree more haha.": return "完全同意，哈哈。";
case "Dont worry about me Lili, I do not think saying goodbye was necessary <3.": return "莉莉，别担心我。我觉得，没必要特地道别<3。";
case "Line realizes that she is in her bed and understands that Sam left her there.": return "莱茵发现自己躺在床上，明白是萨姆把她送回来的。";
