case "Yes, leave it to me and Lili.": return "对，交给我和莉莉吧。";
case "Calm down Lili, she was disoriented from traveling to this dimension.": return "冷静，莉莉，她刚穿越到这个次元，有点迷糊而已。";
case "Finally, Faye We did it, you see Naoki you had the power to do it.": return "终于，菲伊，我们成功了！直树，看吧，你有能力做到。";
case "Ohh Faye you are a sweetheart <3.": return "哦，菲伊，你真贴心<3。";
case "Look like the kettle thing doesn't want you to go to your dimension Faye.": return "看来，那个水壶一样的东西，不想让你回自己的次元啊，菲伊。";
case "What are you thinking so much?": return "你在想什么呢，想这么久？";
case "Hehe I-I guess <3.": return "嘿嘿，我、我想是吧<3。";
case "Kamiko the wyvern": return "翼龙神子";
case "Please shut up, we are talking here.": return "请闭嘴，我们在说话。";
