case "Look, I can't let her go without serving some kind of sentence.": return "听着，我不能让她毫无惩罚地离开。";
case "Line... sorry to tell you that you are under arrest.": return "莱茵……很抱歉，你被捕了。";
case "Could you come for a moment.": return "能过来一下吗？";
case "Ok line that's all we need you can go": return "好了，莱茵，就这些，你可以走了。";
case "We already beat you, surrender like a good kitten.": return "你已经输了，像只乖猫咪一样投降吧。";
