case "Shit Line you pass out.": return "妈的，莱茵，你昏过去了。";
case "Maybe you could hahaha.": return "也许，你还真可以，哈哈哈。";
case "Really? because I want to live in your armpits o.O.": return "真的？因为我想住在你的腋窝里o.O。";
