case "But I do not understand, why do all that?": return "可我不明白，为什么要做那些事？";
case "You are insane! I do not want to go to jail.": return "你疯了！我可不想坐牢。";
case "Ohh ok I will just move it from one side to the other..": return "哦，好，我只是把它，从一边挪到另一边……";
case "Line starts to take out the milk bucket.": return "莱茵开始搬出奶桶。";
case "She says she understands and will never do it again.": return "她说，她明白了，再也不会这样。";
case "Ehhh... Agh it's ok what should I do.": return "呃……唉，好吧，该怎么做？";
case "Line? I need your help damn it, go to my place now!": return "莱茵？我需要你帮忙，妈的，立刻来我那里！";
case "Shit, I really don't want to but I didn't have time to look for someone.": return "妈的，真不想这么做，可没时间再找别人了。";
