case "Line what are you waiting for stop talking and go to work!": return "莱茵，还等什么，别聊了，去干活！";
case "W-would you really come ;c?": return "你、你真的会来;c？";
case "Oh, okay, I-I will visit you when you do.": return "哦，好，你、你安顿好后，我会去看你的。";
case "Look at the sea serpent, it is so cute! <3": return "看那条海蛇，好可爱<3！";
case "Lili, did I wake up before you?": return "莉莉，我居然醒得比你早？";
case "Hey you cannot pass without paying the toll.": return "喂，没交过路费，不能过去。";
case "Here you have my stinking foot": return "给，我的臭脚。";
case "Like the closet thirsty succubus that you are.": return "就像你这只装正经、却饥渴得要命的魅魔。";
case "You will have to touch yourself here in front of passersby.": return "你得在这里，当着来来往往的人自慰。";
case "Please do not take Lili.": return "求你了，别带走莉莉。";
case "Well it does not matter I will go to your base.": return "好吧，没关系，我去你们基地。";
case "Yes! and I'll take out the wanted posters.": return "好！我也会撤下通缉令。";
case "The only way you can get rid of this is by reaching climax.": return "要摆脱这个，唯一的办法，就是达到高潮。";
