case "Stop right there you criminal scum!": return "站住，你这犯罪渣滓！";
case "Of course Line, there is no problem with that.": return "当然，莱茵，完全没问题。";
case "Oh... I thought we could spend a little more time together but, its ok.": return "哦……本来还想，跟你多待一会儿，不过，也没关系。";
